# README media: TILTSHOT. The GIF is the demo player's own route on The Chute
# (real button presses): a putt off the tee, slammed onto the drop, on fire
# up the far bank and into the cup. The stills are the title, a hole card,
# the demo player in flight on its routes, the warning and the board.
shotscale 2
seed 31
game tiltshot
wait 90
shot tiltshot_title
# The Chute: the slam onto the drop, the fire, the hole in one
cheat hole 5
gifstart tiltshot 3 2
botuntil state == 7 1200
wait 60
gifstop
wait 200
# Skylark: over the canyon between the sparks
cheat hole 4
botuntil ball_x > 250 600
shot tiltshot_skylark
# The Pagoda: rattling down through the pegs
cheat hole 17
botuntil ball_x > 320 600
wait 8
shot tiltshot_pagoda
# the card for the last hole
cheat card 18
wait 30
shot tiltshot_card
# held too long: EASY NOW!, the golfer flashing red
cheat hole 12
wait 20
hold A 100
shot tiltshot_warn
release A
wait 120
# the board after the first hole
cheat hole 1
botuntil state == 8 3000
wait 60
shot tiltshot_board
